+A `train` or `train-edge5` command can use `--check-only` instead of `--updates`, with a distinct output directory. It prepares one effective batch and runs one microbatch forward/backward with zero updates and no optimizer. For an auxiliary recipe it selects the first active microbatch; if all eight samples are inactive, it records the inactive case and checks FM only. It is not the complete historical permutation or optimizer-update suite. Importing the package or requesting help starts no training.
 
